<title>UK: P&amp;O, Stena Line conclude ferry line merger.</title>
<headline>P&amp;O, Stena Line conclude ferry line merger.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Peninsular and Oriental Steam Navigation Company and Stena Line AB said on Monday that they had signed an agreement to merge their ferry businesses operating in the English Channel to form a new line.</p>
<p>The line, P&amp;O Stena Line, would be subject to regulatory approval, the firms said in a joint statement.</p>
<p>The deal was announced in October.</p>
</text>
